translation.grantRequest.titleMcp_other	Remove the {{botName}}'s access to {{count}} MCP sign-ins?
translation.grantRequest.titlePlugin_one	Remove the {{botName}}'s access to a plugin?
translation.grantRequest.titlePlugin_other	Remove the {{botName}}'s access to {{count}} plugins?
translation.grantRequest.titleAutomation_one	Remove the {{botName}}'s access to a personal automation?
translation.grantRequest.titleAutomation_other	Remove the {{botName}}'s access to {{count}} personal automations?
translation.grantRequest.noteRemoveConsent	Confirm stops the {{botName}} opening pull requests as these people from now on; a pull request it already opened is unchanged. Each person can allow it again from their own settings.
translation.grantRequest.noteRemoveMcp	Confirm removes only these sign-ins. A plugin that came with a sign-in is removed once none of the giver's sign-ins support it. The giver can grant them again from chat or the Access tab.
translation.grantRequest.noteRemove	Confirm removes this access; anything already gone is skipped. The giver can grant it again from chat or the Access tab.
translation.grantRequest.removeLater	You can remove the access later under the {{botName}}'s settings > Access, in the list of what it can access, or by asking it to.
translation.grantRequest.noteSecrets	Approving shares your personal secrets with these keys; keys you do not have are skipped. {{removeLater}}
translation.grantRequest.noteMcp_one	Approving lets the {{botName}} connect to this MCP server with your own sign-in. {{removeLater}}
translation.grantRequest.noteMcp_other	Approving lets the {{botName}} connect to these MCP servers with your own sign-in. {{removeLater}}
translation.grantRequest.notePlugins	Approving gives the {{botName}} your own copies of these plugins, with your sign-ins on the MCP servers they declare. {{removeLater}}
translation.grantRequest.noteAutomations_one	Approving lets the {{botName}} read and change this personal automation of yours as you can (its triggers, prompt and runs; edit, enable, run and delete it), but not switch it to run as the organization. You can remove the access later from the {{botName}}'s Share dialog.
translation.grantRequest.noteAutomations_other	Approving lets the {{botName}} read and change these personal automations of yours as you can (their triggers, prompts and runs; edit, enable, run and delete them), but not switch them to run as the organization. You can remove the access later from the {{botName}}'s Share dialog.
translation.grantRequest.noteSessions_one	Approving shares the session with the {{botName}} at your own level or below. {{removeLater}}
translation.grantRequest.noteSessions_other	Approving shares these sessions with the {{botName}} at your own level or below. {{removeLater}}
